    "ruleType": "unit-ability",
    "group": "Krieg Combat Engineers",
    "summary": "Once per battle, as [your Shooting phase](vsdata:core-rule/shooting-phase) begins, you can pick an enemy unit up to 9\" from the bearer and [visible](vsdata:core-rule/visibility) to it, and roll a D6. On a 3+, it takes D3 [mortal wounds](vsdata:core-rule/mortal-wounds), rising to 2D3 if it has the **VEHICLE** or **FORTIFICATIONS** keyword.\n\n**Designer's Note**: keep a Remote Mine token beside the unit until this ability is used.",
